    you control, including this card. If you have no Spells/Traps in your GY: You
    can target 1 "Superheavy Samurai" Synchro Monster you control; reduce its Level
    by 1, and if you do, Special Summon this card from your GY, also you cannot Special
    Summon monsters for the rest of this turn, except "Superheavy Samurai" monsters.
    You can only use each effect of "Superheavy Samurai Fist" once per turn.'
